# ── Content pack: source of truth for all site copy ──
# NEVER commit. This repo is public, and the pack contains ⛔ items (phone
# number, home-address reference, unauthorised lender names) plus the
# discrepancy log — working notes about mismatches in Milan's own public
# record, which would damage credibility if published.
# See content-pack/README.md for how to restore it on a new machine.
# content_pack.md
# /content-pack/content_pack.md

# ── Employer artifacts — NEVER commit, in any form ──
# Guards against accidentally dropping source material into the repo.
# Real examples seen during Phase 4 research: a UAT notebook containing an
# admin token and session cookie; policy configs with live thresholds; an
# OKR workbook with colleagues' names and business volumes.
*.ipynb
*.xlsx
*.docx
/policies/
uat*.py
**/all_lender_responses.json
